── MISMATCHED TYPES ─────────────── E0311_none_for_a_plain_type.lt:2:20  [E0311]

Expected `i64`, found `Option<_>`:

  2 │   let count: i64 = None
    │                    ^^^^

Stilt has no null: a value that may be missing has the type `Option<i64>`, which
is `None` or `Some(x)`. Write that type where the value is expected, or give a
value of type `i64`.
